@startuml 001-seq-import-preview
title 001 Sheets Import - Preview detected questions

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
autonumber

actor Teacher
participant "Teacher UI" as TUI
participant "API server" as API
participant "Sheets adapter" as SA
participant "Guided Notes parser" as PARSER
participant "Google Sheets API" as GSA

Teacher -> TUI : paste spreadsheet URL
TUI -> API : request tab list (url)
API -> SA : listTabs(url)
alt URL is not a Google Sheets spreadsheet link
  SA --> API : InvalidUrl
  API --> TUI : error "not a Google Sheets link"
else valid URL
  SA -> GSA : read spreadsheet metadata (read-only)
  alt not shared with service account
    GSA --> SA : permission denied
    SA --> API : NotShared(serviceAccountEmail)
    API --> TUI : error + "share with <service account email>"
  else spreadsheet not found
    GSA --> SA : not found
    SA --> API : NotFound
    API --> TUI : error "spreadsheet not found"
  else readable
    GSA --> SA : title, tabs
    SA --> API : tabs
    API --> TUI : tabs; preselect tab matching #gid=\n(else first tab)
  end
end

Teacher -> TUI : keep preselected tab or select another
TUI -> API : request preview (url, tab)
API -> SA : readTab(url, tab)
SA -> GSA : read cell values + merged ranges (read-only)
GSA --> SA : cell grid
SA -> PARSER : parse(grid)
PARSER -> PARSER : find header row (題號 / 作答)
PARSER -> PARSER : scan rows below header:\nnumbered rows (n, n., n、, Qn, qn;\nhalf/full-width digits),\n（k）/(k) markers, skip blank rows
PARSER -> PARSER : unrecognised 題號 cell ->\nwarning (row + content)
PARSER -> PARSER : unnumbered row with non-marker\nanswer text -> no slot, warning\n(cell + text)
PARSER -> PARSER : any slot cell with text beyond\nits own marker -> warning\n(cell + text; export will replace it)
PARSER -> PARSER : classify SINGLE / 題組,\ncompute answer cell per slot
PARSER -> PARSER : collect errors and warnings\n(row / cell + remedy)
PARSER --> SA : ImportPreview
SA --> API : ImportPreview
API --> TUI : questions, slots, answer cells,\nerrors, warnings, totals
TUI --> Teacher : show preview\n(confirm disabled if errors)

note over SA, GSA
  Import never writes to the sheet (FR-005).
end note

note over TUI, API
  Every request here is teacher-only:
  feature 002's teacher passcode check applies.
end note
@enduml
